{
  "name": "Helpdesk A: New complaint sync",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## A: New complaint → Google Sheets\n1. Edit **Config**: paste your Spreadsheet ID; keep sheetName `IT Complaints`.\n2. Attach credentials: Webhook = Header Auth (name `X-Webhook-Secret`), Google Sheets nodes = Google Service Account.\n3. Never change **Cell Format** from RAW.\n4. Activate, then copy the PRODUCTION webhook URL into the app.\nSee n8n/README.md.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "a5a2021c-697f-50bd-9eaf-79be3d459614",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        40
      ]
    },
